{%- comment -%}
  T-0532 part S, design section 5: the CVEs tab's Details fact sheet, built the same way
  as the nKEVs one (see that page's comment) over wire.cves, with the CVEs tab's own
  shape guard (a CVE id in CVE shape) matching the page's loop, so the row count equals
  the tab's. cve.now's model-written summaries are never read here: no summary or context
  key is emitted, and none exists in wire.yml to emit.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign wire = site.data.wire -%}
{"generated_at": {{ wire.cves_generated_at | jsonify }}, "rows": {
{%- assign first = true -%}
{%- for r in wire.cves -%}
{%- assign cve_head = r.cve | slice: 0, 4 -%}
{%- if cve_head == "CVE-" -%}
{%- unless first -%},{%- endunless -%}{%- assign first = false -%}
{%- include wire-details-row.html r=r -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
}}
